{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"晨早新聞重點｜中俄美元首互動　今舉行歷史性三方會談\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/H-APEC-TRUMP-261119A.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】11月19日now早晨新聞重點</p><p>【親自接機】國家主席習近平親自到機場迎接美國總統特朗普，歡迎他再次訪華。</p><p>【元首互動】習近平設宴款待出席APEC會議的領袖，普京、特朗普在大合照前，互相打招呼。</p><p>【中俄美會談】中俄美元首今天將舉行歷史性三方會談，莫斯科表示他們將會討論最棘手的問題。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T23:44:24.248151+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T23:17:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T18:15:10.582190+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T23:37:53.376679+00:00","content_hash":"e5961c765859e2e58456d13a2922954fa991ff107e518dd5ee69b7bec412e2a0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T23:44:24.248151+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}